    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n          一彈簧原長 <strong>$20\\text{ cm}$</strong>，力常數為 <strong>$10\\text{ kgw/m}$</strong>，一端懸於天花板，另一端懸掛 <strong>$3\\text{ kgw}$</strong> 之重錘，如下圖所示。\n        </p>\n<p>\n          當系統達靜力平衡時，量得彈簧長為 <strong>$30\\text{ cm}$</strong>，則<strong>重錘作用於木板之力大小為多少？</strong>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"condition-list\">\n<li><strong>(A)</strong> $0.5\\text{ kgw}$</li>\n<li><strong>(B)</strong> $3\\text{ kgw}$</li>\n<li><strong>(C)</strong> $2\\text{ kgw}$</li>\n<li><strong>(D)</strong> $1\\text{ kgw}$</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>",
    "options": [],
