    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n          如圖所示，水平光滑地面上有一物體，兩端分別連接兩彈簧，力常數分別為 <strong>$k_1 = 2\\text{ kgw/cm}$</strong>，<strong>$k_2 = 4\\text{ kgw/cm}$</strong>，兩彈簧另一端分別固定於兩側豎直牆壁上。\n        </p>\n<p>\n          今施一水平外力將物體<strong>向右平移 $3\\text{ cm}$</strong> 並保持靜止，則<strong>所需之水平外力為多少 $\\text{kgw}$？</strong>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"condition-list\">\n<li><strong>(A)</strong> $6\\text{ kgw}$</li>\n<li><strong>(B)</strong> $8\\text{ kgw}$</li>\n<li><strong>(C)</strong> $12\\text{ kgw}$</li>\n<li><strong>(D)</strong> $18\\text{ kgw}$</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>",
