    "id": "torque4",
    "index": 28,
    "title": "27. 【力矩 4】98指考圓輪推上階梯臨界力矩",
    "category": "",
    "tags": [
      "98 指考計算題",
      "講義 靜力學-22"
    ],
    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n          有一半徑為 <strong>$R$</strong>、重為 <strong>$W$</strong>、材質均勻的光滑輪子，與高 <strong>$h$</strong> 的階梯接觸，靜置於水平地面上。今在輪子中心處施一水平力 <strong>$F$</strong>，使其爬上階梯，若輪子不變形，回答下列問題：\n        </p>\n\n<div class=\"sub-question\" id=\"part1\">\n<div class=\"sub-title\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">1</span>\n            問題 (1)：尚未脫離地面時，輪子共受到哪些力的作用？\n          </div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 0.95rem; color: #cbd5e1;\">請選擇完整的受力組合：</p>\n<div class=\"option-grid\">\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"A\" data-part=\"1\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">A</span>\n<span>受 2 個力：外力 $F$ 與重力 $W$</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"B\" data-part=\"1\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">B</span>\n<span>受 3 個力：外力 $F$、重力 $W$、階梯支持力 $N'$</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"true\" data-opt=\"C\" data-part=\"1\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">C</span>\n<span>受 4 個力：外力 $F$、重力 $W$、地面正向力 $N$、階梯角支持力 $N'$</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"D\" data-part=\"1\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">D</span>\n<span>受 5 個力：外力 $F$、重力 $W$、地面正向力 $N$、階梯支持力 $N'$ 及地面靜摩擦力 $f$（光滑輪子地面無摩擦）</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"feedback-msg\" id=\"msg1\" style=\"display:none; margin-top:12px; font-size:0.92rem;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-question\" id=\"part2\">\n<div class=\"sub-title\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">2</span>\n            問題 (2)：若設階梯支持力 $N'$ 與水平夾角為 $\\theta$，水平與垂直分力的平衡方程式為何？\n          </div>\n<div class=\"callout-box\">\n            幾何關係提示：階梯角 $A$ 與圓心 $O$ 連線長為 $R$，垂直高差為 $R-h$。故 $\\sin\\theta = \\frac{R-h}{R}$，$\\cos\\theta = \\frac{\\sqrt{h(2R-h)}}{R}$。\n          </div>\n<div class=\"option-grid\">\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"true\" data-opt=\"A\" data-part=\"2\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">A</span>\n<span>水平：$N'\\cos\\theta = F$，垂直：$N + N'\\sin\\theta = W$</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"B\" data-part=\"2\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">B</span>\n<span>水平：$N'\\sin\\theta = F$，垂直：$N + N'\\cos\\theta = W$</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"C\" data-part=\"2\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">C</span>\n<span>水平：$N' = F$，垂直：$N = W$</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"D\" data-part=\"2\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">D</span>\n<span>水平：$N'\\cos\\theta + F = 0$，垂直：$N'\\sin\\theta = W + N$</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"feedback-msg\" id=\"msg2\" style=\"display:none; margin-top:12px; font-size:0.92rem;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-question\" id=\"part3\">\n<div class=\"sub-title\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">3</span>\n            問題 (3)：以接觸點 A 為支點，在圓心處最少需施力多少才能使輪子脫離地面？\n          </div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 0.95rem; color: #cbd5e1;\">臨界脫離時地面支持力 $N = 0$，力矩平衡條件：</p>\n<div class=\"option-grid\">\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"A\" data-part=\"3\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">A</span>\n<span>$F_{\\min} = W \\frac{R-h}{\\sqrt{h(2R-h)}}$</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"true\" data-opt=\"B\" data-part=\"3\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">B</span>\n<span>$F_{\\min} = W \\frac{\\sqrt{h(2R-h)}}{R-h}$</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"C\" data-part=\"3\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">C</span>\n<span>$F_{\\min} = W \\frac{h}{R}$</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"option-btn\" data-correct=\"false\" data-opt=\"D\" data-part=\"3\">\n<span class=\"opt-label\">D</span>\n<span>$F_{\\min} = W \\frac{R}{\\sqrt{h(2R-h)}}$</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"feedback-msg\" id=\"msg3\" style=\"display:none; margin-top:12px; font-size:0.92rem;\"></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>",
    "options": [],
    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 320\" style=\"max-width: 500px;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <!-- Ground -->\n  <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <!-- Step -->\n  <line x1=\"340\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <line x1=\"340\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"510\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n  <polygon points=\"340,260 340,200 510,200 510,260\" fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"365\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#facc15\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"375\" y=\"235\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">階高 h</text>\n\n  <!-- Wheel Body: R = 90px, Center at (255, 170) -->\n  <circle cx=\"255\" cy=\"170\" r=\"90\" fill=\"rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.08)\" stroke=\"#00e5ff\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"255\" cy=\"170\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#facc15\"/>\n  <text x=\"238\" y=\"165\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">圓心 O</text>\n\n  <!-- Horizontal Force F -->\n  <line x1=\"255\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"335\" y2=\"170\" stroke=\"#facc15\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex2-gold)\"/>\n  <text x=\"290\" y=\"155\" fill=\"#facc15\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\">水平外力 F</text>\n\n  <!-- Step Corner A at (340, 200) -->\n  <circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"200\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#00e676\"/>\n  <text x=\"350\" y=\"195\" fill=\"#00e676\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\">A (階梯角)</text>\n\n  <!-- Gravity W -->\n  <line x1=\"255\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"255\" y2=\"245\" stroke=\"#ff5252\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-ex1-red)\"/>\n  <text x=\"260\" y=\"235\" fill=\"#ff5252\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\">重力 W</text>\n\n  <!-- Radius line from O to A -->\n  <line x1=\"255\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\"/>\n  <text x=\"290\" y=\"195\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"11\">半徑 R</text>\n</svg>",
