    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n          如下圖所示，物體（圓球）的重量是 <strong>$W$</strong>，以輕繩懸於光滑的鉛直壁上。已知繩與鉛直壁的夾角是 <strong>$\\theta$</strong>，則繩之張力量值為？\n        </p>\n\n\n\n</div>",
    "options": [
      "(A) $W\\sin\\theta$",
      "(B) $W\\cos\\theta$",
      "(C) $W\\sec\\theta$（即 $\\dfrac{W}{\\cos\\theta}$）",
      "(D) $W\\csc\\theta$"
    ],
