      "(A) $\\dfrac{W}{\\sin\\theta}$",
      "(B) $\\dfrac{W}{\\cos\\theta}$",
      "(C) $\\dfrac{W}{2\\sin\\theta}$",
      "(D) $\\dfrac{W}{2\\cos\\theta}$",
