    "tags": [
      "講義 靜力學-25"
    ],
    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n          重 $2W$ 之物體，置於光滑斜面上。同時施一<strong>平行於斜面向上之拉力 $W$</strong>，以及一<strong>水平向右方向之推力 $W$</strong>，恰使物體靜止不動。則斜面作用在物體的正向力為多少 $W$？\n        </p>\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n<svg class=\"physics-svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 760 380\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow-blue\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#38bdf8\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-red\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#f43f5e\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-green\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-amber\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-purple\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#c084fc\"></path>\n</marker>\n<pattern height=\"8\" id=\"diag-hatch\" patterntransform=\"rotate(45 0 0)\" patternunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"8\">\n<line stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.2)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"8\"></line>\n</pattern>\n</defs>\n<!-- Left: Physical Scenario -->\n<!-- Incline: theta = 53 deg (cos=0.6, sin=0.8). dx = 200, dy = 266. -->\n<!-- Base from (40, 320) to (300, 320), Height at (40, 54) -->\n<!-- Ground hatch -->\n<rect fill=\"url(#diag-hatch)\" height=\"15\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"310\" x=\"30\" y=\"320\"></rect>\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"30\" x2=\"340\" y1=\"320\" y2=\"320\"></line>\n<!-- Incline triangle: Corner at (70, 320), Apex at (270, 54), Base right at (270, 320). Wait, incline sloping up to the right:\n                 Let base be (60, 320) to (290, 320). Incline from (60, 320) up-right to (260, 60).\n            -->\n<polygon fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7)\" points=\"60,320 280,320 280,70\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\"></polygon>\n<!-- Angle theta arc at (60, 320) -->\n<path d=\"M 120 320 A 60 60 0 0 0 108 272\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"135\" y=\"305\">θ (53°)</text>\n<!-- Block on Incline:\n                 Center at around (170, 195).\n                 Angle is -48.7° or 53°. Slope is 250 / 220 ~ 1.14 (or dy=-250, dx=220).\n            -->\n<g transform=\"translate(170, 195) rotate(-53)\">\n<rect fill=\"rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25)\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"60\" x=\"-30\" y=\"-40\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(53)\" x=\"0\" y=\"-15\">2W</text>\n</g>\n<!-- Force vectors centered at (170, 180) -->\n<!-- 1. Gravity 2W: vertically downwards -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\" stroke=\"#f43f5e\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"170\" x2=\"170\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"280\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f43f5e\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"180\" y=\"270\">2W (重力)</text>\n<!-- 2. Parallel pull force W: directed up the incline (angle -53 deg: dx=50*cos53=30, dy=-50*sin53=-40) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-green)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"170\" x2=\"225\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"107\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"235\" y=\"115\">平行拉力 W</text>\n<!-- 3. Horizontal push force W: horizontally to the right -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-amber)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"100\" x2=\"162\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"180\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"80\" y=\"170\">水平推力 W</text>\n<!-- 4. Normal Force N: perpendicular to incline, up-left (perpendicular to 53 deg: dx=-70*sin53=-56, dy=-70*cos53=-42) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-purple)\" stroke=\"#c084fc\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"170\" x2=\"90\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"120\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#c084fc\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" x=\"65\" y=\"110\">N (正向力)</text>\n<circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"180\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" r=\"4.5\"></circle>\n<!-- Right Box: Vector Closed Polygon Analysis -->\n<g transform=\"translate(420, 35)\">\n<rect fill=\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75)\" height=\"315\" rx=\"12\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"310\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"155\" y=\"28\">向量閉合法：封閉四邊形</text>\n<!-- Polygon representation:\n                   Start at Top: (180, 50)\n                   Vector 1: Gravity 2W straight down from (180, 50) to (180, 230) [length 180]\n                   Vector 2: Horizontal push W right from (180, 230) to (270, 230) [length 90]\n                   Vector 3: Parallel pull W up-left from (270, 230) to (216, 158) [length 90 at 53 deg]\n                   Vector 4: Normal force N up-left from (216, 158) back to (180, 50) [length 180]\n              -->\n<!-- Gravity 2W -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\" stroke=\"#f43f5e\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"180\" x2=\"180\" y1=\"50\" y2=\"230\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f43f5e\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"130\" y=\"145\">2W (向下)</text>\n<!-- Push W -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-amber)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"180\" x2=\"260\" y1=\"230\" y2=\"230\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"215\" y=\"252\">W (水平推)</text>\n<!-- Pull W -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-green)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"260\" x2=\"212\" y1=\"230\" y2=\"166\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"250\" y=\"195\">W (平行拉)</text>\n<!-- Normal N -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-purple)\" stroke=\"#c084fc\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"212\" x2=\"183\" y1=\"166\" y2=\"55\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#c084fc\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" x=\"215\" y=\"105\">N (正向力)</text>\n<!-- Dash split showing two congruent triangles -->\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"180\" x2=\"212\" y1=\"230\" y2=\"166\"></line>\n<!-- Note -->\n<rect fill=\"rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1)\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3)\" stroke-width=\"1\" width=\"270\" x=\"20\" y=\"270\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"155\" y=\"291\">幾何全等對稱：直接看出 N = 2W</text>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</div>\n<p class=\"question-prompt\">\n          請問斜面作用在物體上的正向力為多少倍的 $W$？\n        </p>\n\n\n</div>",
    "options": [
      "(A) $1\\,W$",
      "(B) $\\sqrt{2}\\,W$",
      "(C) $\\frac{3}{2}\\,W$",
      "(D) $2\\,W$",
      "(E) $\\frac{5}{2}\\,W$"
    ],
