    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n          小軒要在客廳裡掛上一幅重 $1\\text{ kgw}$ 的畫（含畫框），畫框背面有兩個相距 $1\\text{ m}$、位置固定的釘子。他將畫對稱地掛在牆壁的掛鉤上，掛繩最大可以承受 $1\\text{ kgw}$ 的張力，掛好後整條細繩呈緊繃狀態。假設細繩可以承受的最大張力與繩長無關，則細繩<strong>最少需要幾公尺</strong>才不至於斷掉？\n        </p>\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n<svg class=\"physics-svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 760 380\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow-blue\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#38bdf8\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-red\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#f43f5e\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-amber\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"></path>\n</marker>\n<lineargradient id=\"frame-grad\" x1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y1=\"0%\" y2=\"100%\">\n<stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#334155\"></stop>\n<stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#1e293b\"></stop>\n</lineargradient>\n</defs>\n<!-- Painting Frame Outline -->\n<rect fill=\"url(#frame-grad)\" height=\"190\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" width=\"340\" x=\"70\" y=\"160\"></rect>\n<rect fill=\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6)\" height=\"150\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"300\" x=\"90\" y=\"180\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"240\" y=\"260\">畫作本體（含框重 W = 1 kgw）</text>\n<!-- Hook on Wall: Point H (240, 50) -->\n<circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"50\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" r=\"5\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"240\" y=\"35\">掛鉤 (H)</text>\n<!-- Nails on Frame: distance = 1 m -->\n<!-- Hook is at x = 240. Nails at x = 240 - 100 = 140, and 240 + 100 = 340. y = 190. -->\n<circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"190\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" r=\"4.5\" stroke=\"#0ea5e9\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"125\" y=\"180\">釘子 A</text>\n<circle cx=\"340\" cy=\"190\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" r=\"4.5\" stroke=\"#0ea5e9\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"355\" y=\"180\">釘子 B</text>\n<!-- Dimension Line between Nails (1 m) -->\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"140\" x2=\"340\" y1=\"210\" y2=\"210\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"140\" x2=\"140\" y1=\"205\" y2=\"215\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"340\" x2=\"340\" y1=\"205\" y2=\"215\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"240\" y=\"225\">d = 1 m (兩釘子相距 1m)</text>\n<!-- Hanging String -->\n<line stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"140\" x2=\"240\" y1=\"190\" y2=\"50\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"340\" x2=\"240\" y1=\"190\" y2=\"50\"></line>\n<!-- Vertical Dash Line at Hook -->\n<line stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,4\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"240\" x2=\"240\" y1=\"50\" y2=\"190\"></line>\n<!-- Angle theta with vertical -->\n<path d=\"M 220 78 A 35 35 0 0 1 240 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"215\" y=\"100\">θ</text>\n<path d=\"M 260 78 A 35 35 0 0 0 240 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"260\" y=\"100\">θ</text>\n<!-- Half Base d/2 = 0.5 m -->\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"12\" font-style=\"italic\" x=\"185\" y=\"180\">0.5 m</text>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"12\" font-style=\"italic\" x=\"285\" y=\"180\">0.5 m</text>\n<!-- String segments length L/2 -->\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" x=\"170\" y=\"110\">L/2</text>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" x=\"300\" y=\"110\">L/2</text>\n<!-- Force Vectors on Hook/System -->\n<!-- Tension T_max = 1 kgw along string -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"240\" x2=\"200\" y1=\"50\" y2=\"106\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"165\" y=\"80\">T ≤ 1 kgw</text>\n<!-- Gravity W downwards from painting center -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\" stroke=\"#f43f5e\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"240\" x2=\"240\" y1=\"260\" y2=\"330\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f43f5e\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"250\" y=\"325\">W = 1 kgw</text>\n<!-- Right: Physics & Geometry Analysis Box -->\n<g transform=\"translate(460, 40)\">\n<rect fill=\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75)\" height=\"305\" rx=\"12\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"275\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"137\" y=\"30\">受力平衡與臨界條件</text>\n<!-- Derivation items -->\n<text fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" x=\"20\" y=\"65\">1. 鉛直方向力平衡：</text>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"14\" x=\"35\" y=\"90\">2T·cos θ = W = 1</text>\n<text fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" x=\"20\" y=\"125\">2. 最大張力臨界值 (T = 1 kgw)：</text>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"14\" x=\"35\" y=\"150\">2(1)·cos θ = 1</text>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"14\" x=\"35\" y=\"175\">⇒ cos θ = 1/2  (θ = 60°)</text>\n<text fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" x=\"20\" y=\"210\">3. 幾何直角三角形：</text>\n<text fill=\"#10b981\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"35\" y=\"235\">sin θ = (d/2) / (L/2)</text>\n<text fill=\"#10b981\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"14\" x=\"35\" y=\"260\">L = 2 × (0.5 / sin 60°)</text>\n<rect fill=\"rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15)\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" width=\"235\" x=\"20\" y=\"270\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"137\" y=\"288\">L_min = 2 / √3 (m)</text>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</div>\n<p class=\"question-prompt\">\n          依據上述受力與幾何限制，細繩最短需為幾公尺才不至於斷掉？\n        </p>\n\n\n</div>",
    "options": [
      "(A) $\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}\\text{ m}$",
      "(B) $\\frac{3}{2}\\text{ m}$",
      "(C) $2\\text{ m}$",
      "(D) $\\frac{5}{2}\\text{ m}$",
      "(E) $2\\sqrt{3}\\text{ m}$"
    ],
