    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n          如圖所示，將三個半徑皆為 $R$、重量皆為 $W$ 的相同小球 $A$、$B$、$C$ 靜置於半徑為 $3R$ 的光滑大碗內。已知頂部 $C$ 球之球心恰好位在大碗之圓心處，且三球球心連線構成一正三角形。試求：<br/>\n          (1) $B$、$C$ 兩球間之相互作用力為多少？<br/>\n          (2) $A$、$B$ 兩球間之相互作用力為多少？<br/>\n          (3) $A$ 球作用於碗壁之力為多少？\n        </p>\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n<svg class=\"physics-svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 760 380\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow-blue\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#38bdf8\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-red\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#f43f5e\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-green\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-amber\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"></path>\n</marker>\n<radialgradient cx=\"35%\" cy=\"35%\" id=\"sphereA\" r=\"65%\">\n<stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#bae6fd\"></stop>\n<stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#38bdf8\"></stop>\n<stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"></stop>\n</radialgradient>\n<radialgradient cx=\"35%\" cy=\"35%\" id=\"sphereB\" r=\"65%\">\n<stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#fed7aa\"></stop>\n<stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#f97316\"></stop>\n<stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#c2410c\"></stop>\n</radialgradient>\n<radialgradient cx=\"35%\" cy=\"35%\" id=\"sphereC\" r=\"65%\">\n<stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#dcfce7\"></stop>\n<stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#22c55e\"></stop>\n<stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#15803d\"></stop>\n</radialgradient>\n</defs>\n<!-- Big Bowl: Radius 3R = 195 px. Center O at (240, 115).\n                 Bowl arc from (45, 115) to (435, 115)\n            -->\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"30\" x2=\"450\" y1=\"115\" y2=\"115\"></line>\n<path d=\"M 45 115 A 195 195 0 0 0 435 115\" fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4)\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"4\"></path>\n<!-- Bowl Stand -->\n<path d=\"M 180 305 L 300 305 L 320 345 L 160 345 Z\" fill=\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8)\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"140\" x2=\"340\" y1=\"345\" y2=\"345\"></line>\n<!-- Sphere C center is at Bowl center O: (240, 115). Radius R = 65 px. -->\n<!-- Spheres A & B:\n                 Side of equilateral triangle = 2R = 130 px.\n                 Distance from C to A = 130 px, at angle 60 deg down-left (30 deg to vertical).\n                 A center: x = 240 - 130*sin(30) = 240 - 65 = 175\n                           y = 115 + 130*cos(30) = 115 + 112.6 = 227.6\n                 B center: x = 240 + 65 = 305\n                           y = 115 + 112.6 = 227.6\n                 Distance between A and B = 130 = 2R.\n                 Distance from Bowl center O to A = 130 = 2R.\n                 Distance from A center to Bowl surface = 130 + 65 = 195 = 3R. Perfect contact!\n            -->\n<!-- Equilateral triangle dashed line -->\n<polygon fill=\"rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08)\" points=\"240,115 175,228 305,228\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></polygon>\n<!-- Sphere A (Bottom Left) -->\n<circle cx=\"175\" cy=\"228\" fill=\"url(#sphereA)\" opacity=\"0.9\" r=\"65\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"175\" cy=\"228\" fill=\"#ffffff\" r=\"4.5\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"175\" y=\"233\">A</text>\n<!-- Sphere B (Bottom Right) -->\n<circle cx=\"305\" cy=\"228\" fill=\"url(#sphereB)\" opacity=\"0.9\" r=\"65\" stroke=\"#f97316\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"305\" cy=\"228\" fill=\"#ffffff\" r=\"4.5\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"305\" y=\"233\">B</text>\n<!-- Sphere C (Top Center) -->\n<circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"115\" fill=\"url(#sphereC)\" opacity=\"0.9\" r=\"65\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"115\" fill=\"#ffffff\" r=\"4.5\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"240\" y=\"120\">C</text>\n<!-- Normal Forces from Bowl: N_A and N_B pointing toward C -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"120\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"323\" y2=\"254\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" x=\"100\" y=\"290\">N_A</text>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"360\" x2=\"320\" y1=\"323\" y2=\"254\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" x=\"370\" y=\"290\">N_B</text>\n<!-- Right Box: Three Step Analysis Diagrams -->\n<g transform=\"translate(460, 20)\">\n<rect fill=\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75)\" height=\"345\" rx=\"12\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"280\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"140\" y=\"26\">三階段受力分析圖解</text>\n<!-- Box 1: Overall System (3 balls) -->\n<rect fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6)\" height=\"90\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1\" width=\"250\" x=\"15\" y=\"40\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"25\" y=\"60\">(1) 整體系統（A+B+C）：</text>\n<text fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"35\" y=\"82\">鉛直平衡：2 N_B·cos 30° = 3W</text>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"35\" y=\"104\">⇒ N_A = N_B = √3 W</text>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"11\" x=\"35\" y=\"122\">（即第 (3) 小題答案：√3 W）</text>\n<!-- Box 2: Top Ball C -->\n<rect fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6)\" height=\"85\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1\" width=\"250\" x=\"15\" y=\"140\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#22c55e\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"25\" y=\"160\">(2) 隔離頂部 C 球：</text>\n<text fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"35\" y=\"182\">鉛直平衡：2 F_BC·cos 30° = W</text>\n<text fill=\"#22c55e\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"35\" y=\"204\">⇒ F_BC = W / √3 = (√3/3)W</text>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"11\" x=\"35\" y=\"220\">（即第 (1) 小題答案）</text>\n<!-- Box 3: Bottom Ball B -->\n<rect fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6)\" height=\"95\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1\" width=\"250\" x=\"15\" y=\"235\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#f97316\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"25\" y=\"255\">(3) 隔離底層 B 球：</text>\n<text fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"35\" y=\"277\">水平平衡：F_AB = (N_B - F_BC)·sin 30°</text>\n<text fill=\"#f97316\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"35\" y=\"299\">F_AB = (2√3/3 W) × 1/2</text>\n<text fill=\"#f97316\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"35\" y=\"320\">⇒ F_AB = (√3/3)W</text>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</div>\n<p class=\"question-prompt\">\n          依據受力平衡分析，三道小題之答案依序為何？\n        </p>\n\n\n</div>",
    "options": [
      "(A) (1) $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}W$；(2) $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}W$；(3) $\\sqrt{3}W$",
      "(B) (1) $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}W$；(2) $\\frac{1}{2}W$；(3) $3W$",
      "(C) (1) $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}W$；(2) $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}W$；(3) $2\\sqrt{3}W$",
      "(D) (1) $\\frac{1}{2}W$；(2) $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}W$；(3) $\\sqrt{3}W$",
      "(E) (1) $\\sqrt{3}W$；(2) $\\sqrt{3}W$；(3) $3W$"
    ],
