    "title": "50. 【平衡 21】均勻平板小孩行走蹺起臨界問題",
    "category": "",
    "tags": [
      "講義 靜力學-27"
    ],
    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n          如圖所示，一長度為 $15\\text{ m}$、重量為 $400\\text{ N}$ 的均勻平板，水平靜止於相距 $8\\text{ m}$ 之兩對稱支柱 $A$、$B$ 上。有一重 $640\\text{ N}$ 之小孩從 $A$ 點開始向右走，試求：<br/>\n          (1) 此小孩可自 $B$ 點再向外走多遠，平板恰好開始蹺起？<br/>\n          (2) 若欲使此小孩能一直安全走至平板最右端端點而平板恰欲蹺起，則支柱 $B$ 應移至距離右端端點多少 $\\text{m}$ 處？\n        </p>\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n<svg class=\"physics-svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 760 380\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow-blue\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#38bdf8\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-red\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#f43f5e\"></path>\n</marker>\n<pattern height=\"8\" id=\"diag-hatch\" patterntransform=\"rotate(45 0 0)\" patternunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"8\">\n<line stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.2)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"8\"></line>\n</pattern>\n</defs>\n<!-- Ground: y = 290 -->\n<rect fill=\"url(#diag-hatch)\" height=\"15\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"410\" x=\"30\" y=\"290\"></rect>\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"20\" x2=\"450\" y1=\"290\" y2=\"290\"></line>\n<!-- Board: length = 15m -> 360 px (scale 24 px/m).\n                 Center of board is at x = 230.\n                 Left end: 230 - 180 = 50.\n                 Right end: 230 + 180 = 410.\n                 y = 220, thickness = 14.\n            -->\n<rect fill=\"rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25)\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"360\" x=\"50\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"230\" y=\"212\">均勻平板長 15m (重 400N)</text>\n<!-- Center of Mass G: at x = 230, y = 228 -->\n<circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"228\" fill=\"#f43f5e\" r=\"4.5\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#f43f5e\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"230\" y=\"248\">重心 G</text>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\" stroke=\"#f43f5e\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"230\" x2=\"230\" y1=\"228\" y2=\"280\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f43f5e\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"240\" y=\"275\">W=400N</text>\n<!-- Supports A and B: distance = 8m -> 8 * 24 = 192 px.\n                 Symmetric about G(230):\n                 A: 230 - 96 = 134.\n                 B: 230 + 96 = 326.\n            -->\n<!-- Support A -->\n<polygon fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8)\" points=\"134,236 120,290 148,290\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></polygon>\n<circle cx=\"134\" cy=\"236\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" r=\"3.5\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#e2e8f0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"134\" y=\"315\">A</text>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"134\" y=\"212\">N_A=0 (臨界)</text>\n<!-- Support B -->\n<polygon fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8)\" points=\"326,236 312,290 340,290\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"></polygon>\n<circle cx=\"326\" cy=\"236\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"326\" y=\"315\">B (轉軸)</text>\n<!-- Dimensions:\n                 From G to B = 4m (96 px)\n                 From G to A = 4m (96 px)\n            -->\n<line stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"134\" x2=\"326\" y1=\"200\" y2=\"200\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"230\" y=\"195\">A、B 間距 8m (兩側各 4m)</text>\n<!-- Child walking beyond B: at x = 326 + 60 = 386 px (2.5m = 60 px) -->\n<!-- Draw stick figure for child -->\n<g transform=\"translate(386, 170)\">\n<!-- Head -->\n<circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" fill=\"#fed7aa\" r=\"9\" stroke=\"#f97316\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle>\n<!-- Body -->\n<line stroke=\"#f97316\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"9\" y2=\"30\"></line>\n<!-- Arms -->\n<line stroke=\"#f97316\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"-8\" x2=\"8\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line>\n<!-- Legs -->\n<line stroke=\"#f97316\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"-8\" y1=\"30\" y2=\"50\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#f97316\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"8\" y1=\"30\" y2=\"50\"></line>\n<!-- Gravity of child -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\" stroke=\"#f43f5e\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"35\" y2=\"70\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f43f5e\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"12\" y=\"65\">640N</text>\n</g>\n<text fill=\"#f97316\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"386\" y=\"155\">小孩 640N</text>\n<!-- Dimension x beyond B -->\n<line stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"326\" x2=\"386\" y1=\"185\" y2=\"185\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"356\" y=\"178\">x = 2.5m</text>\n<!-- Right Box: Torque Balance Derivation -->\n<g transform=\"translate(450, 20)\">\n<rect fill=\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75)\" height=\"345\" rx=\"12\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"290\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"145\" y=\"26\">力矩平衡推導剖析</text>\n<!-- Box 1: Part 1 -->\n<rect fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6)\" height=\"135\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1\" width=\"260\" x=\"15\" y=\"40\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"25\" y=\"62\">(1) 求向外走極限距離 x：</text>\n<text fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"35\" y=\"85\">恰蹺起臨界：N_A = 0，以 B 為轉軸</text>\n<text fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"35\" y=\"105\">逆力矩 (板重) = 順力矩 (小孩)</text>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"35\" y=\"128\">400 × 4 = 640 × x</text>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" x=\"35\" y=\"152\">⇒ x = 1600 / 640 = 2.5 m</text>\n<!-- Box 2: Part 2 -->\n<rect fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6)\" height=\"140\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1\" width=\"260\" x=\"15\" y=\"190\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"25\" y=\"212\">(2) 小孩至最右端，求 B 距端點 y：</text>\n<text fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"35\" y=\"235\">小孩在端點：力臂 = y</text>\n<text fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"35\" y=\"255\">板重心距端點 7.5m：力臂 = 7.5 - y</text>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"35\" y=\"278\">400 × (7.5 - y) = 640 × y</text>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"35\" y=\"300\">3000 = 1040 y</text>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" x=\"35\" y=\"322\">⇒ y = 3000 / 1040 ≈ 2.88 m</text>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</div>\n<p class=\"question-prompt\">\n          依據力矩平衡推導，兩小題之數值分別為何？\n        </p>\n\n\n</div>",
    "options": [
      "(A) (1) $3.5\\text{ m}$；(2) $3.3\\text{ m}$",
      "(B) (1) $3.0\\text{ m}$；(2) $3.0\\text{ m}$",
      "(C) (1) $2.5\\text{ m}$；(2) $2.88\\text{ m}$",
      "(D) (1) $2.0\\text{ m}$；(2) $2.5\\text{ m}$",
      "(E) (1) $1.5\\text{ m}$；(2) $2.0\\text{ m}$"
    ],
