    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n          在光滑水平面上，有一正三角形的均勻面板，現以所示的幾種方式施水平力，圖中各力的大小都相等（施力與面板邊緣的夾角為 $0^\\circ$、$60^\\circ$、$90^\\circ$、$120^\\circ$ 或 $150^\\circ$）。試問下列圖中，哪些施力方式會使面板<strong>「轉動而不會移動」</strong>？\n        </p>\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n<svg class=\"physics-svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 760 330\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow-green\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-red\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#f43f5e\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-blue\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#38bdf8\"></path>\n</marker>\n</defs>\n<!-- 5 Triangular Panels side by side:\n                 Centers at x = 75, 215, 355, 495, 635\n                 y base = 180, side = 70 px. Height = 70 * 0.866 = 60 px.\n                 Apex at y = 120, Base at y = 180.\n            -->\n<!-- Panel (甲) -->\n<g transform=\"translate(15, 0)\">\n<rect fill=\"rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.08)\" height=\"250\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"130\" x=\"10\" y=\"30\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"60\">(甲) ✓ 正確</text>\n<polygon fill=\"#334155\" points=\"75,100 40,165 110,165\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></polygon>\n<!-- Forces cyclic around edges -->\n<!-- Top edge going down-left -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-green)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"75\" x2=\"30\" y1=\"100\" y2=\"183\"></line>\n<!-- Bottom edge going right -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-green)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"40\" x2=\"135\" y1=\"165\" y2=\"165\"></line>\n<!-- Right edge going up-left -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-green)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"110\" x2=\"65\" y1=\"165\" y2=\"80\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"215\">ΣF = 0 (合力零)</text>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"235\">Στ ≠ 0 (轉動！)</text>\n<text fill=\"#e2e8f0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"260\">只轉不移</text>\n</g>\n<!-- Panel (乙) -->\n<g transform=\"translate(160, 0)\">\n<rect fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4)\" height=\"250\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1\" width=\"130\" x=\"10\" y=\"30\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"60\">(乙)</text>\n<polygon fill=\"#334155\" points=\"75,100 40,165 110,165\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></polygon>\n<!-- Forces: one upward at apex, two downward at corners -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\" stroke=\"#f43f5e\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"75\" x2=\"75\" y1=\"100\" y2=\"55\"></line>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\" stroke=\"#f43f5e\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"40\" x2=\"40\" y1=\"165\" y2=\"210\"></line>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\" stroke=\"#f43f5e\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"110\" x2=\"110\" y1=\"165\" y2=\"210\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f43f5e\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"225\">ΣF ≠ 0 (合力非零)</text>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"250\">會產生移動！</text>\n</g>\n<!-- Panel (丙) -->\n<g transform=\"translate(305, 0)\">\n<rect fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4)\" height=\"250\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1\" width=\"130\" x=\"10\" y=\"30\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"60\">(丙)</text>\n<polygon fill=\"#334155\" points=\"75,100 40,165 110,165\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></polygon>\n<!-- Lines pass through a single point -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"75\" x2=\"75\" y1=\"100\" y2=\"155\"></line>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"40\" x2=\"70\" y1=\"165\" y2=\"148\"></line>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"110\" x2=\"80\" y1=\"165\" y2=\"148\"></line>\n<circle cx=\"75\" cy=\"148\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"225\">三力共點 (交於一點)</text>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"250\">Στ = 0 (不轉動)</text>\n</g>\n<!-- Panel (丁) -->\n<g transform=\"translate(450, 0)\">\n<rect fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4)\" height=\"250\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1\" width=\"130\" x=\"10\" y=\"30\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"60\">(丁)</text>\n<polygon fill=\"#334155\" points=\"75,100 40,165 110,165\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></polygon>\n<!-- Forces lines intersect at a point outside or center -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"75\" x2=\"120\" y1=\"100\" y2=\"100\"></line>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"40\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"165\" y2=\"185\"></line>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"110\" x2=\"145\" y1=\"165\" y2=\"185\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"225\">延長線交於同一點</text>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"250\">Στ = 0 (不轉動)</text>\n</g>\n<!-- Panel (戊) -->\n<g transform=\"translate(595, 0)\">\n<rect fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4)\" height=\"250\" rx=\"10\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1\" width=\"130\" x=\"10\" y=\"30\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"60\">(戊)</text>\n<polygon fill=\"#334155\" points=\"75,100 40,165 110,165\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></polygon>\n<!-- Symmetrical outward radial forces -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"75\" x2=\"75\" y1=\"100\" y2=\"55\"></line>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"40\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"165\" y2=\"185\"></line>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"110\" x2=\"140\" y1=\"165\" y2=\"185\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"225\">對稱輻射共點</text>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"75\" y=\"250\">ΣF = 0 且 Στ = 0</text>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</div>\n<p class=\"question-prompt\">\n          試問上述五種施力方式中，何者會使面板<strong>「轉動而不會移動」</strong>？\n        </p>\n\n\n</div>",
