    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n          如圖所示，一木棒長 $L$（重量可忽略不計），在距離牆壁 $\\frac{2}{3}L$ 處懸掛一重量為 $W$ 之物體。木棒一端以一樞紐固定於鉛直牆上，另一端用細繩以與水平夾角 $30^\\circ$ 懸於牆上使其維持水平平衡。則牆上樞紐作用於棒的作用力大小為：\n        </p>\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n<svg class=\"physics-svg\" viewbox=\"0 0 760 360\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow-blue\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#38bdf8\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-red\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#f43f5e\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-green\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-purple\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#c084fc\"></path>\n</marker>\n<pattern height=\"8\" id=\"diag-hatch\" patterntransform=\"rotate(45 0 0)\" patternunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"8\">\n<line stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.2)\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"8\"></line>\n</pattern>\n</defs>\n<!-- Vertical Wall on Left: x = 90 -->\n<rect fill=\"url(#diag-hatch)\" height=\"300\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"25\" x=\"65\" y=\"25\"></rect>\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"90\" x2=\"90\" y1=\"20\" y2=\"330\"></line>\n<!-- Pivot A at (90, 220) -->\n<circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"220\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" r=\"7\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"800\" x=\"60\" y=\"225\">A</text>\n<!-- Horizontal Rod AB: from A(90, 220) to B(390, 220). Length L = 300 px. -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"8\" x1=\"90\" x2=\"390\" y1=\"220\" y2=\"220\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#e2e8f0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"395\" y=\"235\">B</text>\n<!-- String from B(390, 220) to Wall C(90, 46.8).\n                 tan 30 = dy / dx = 173.2 / 300 ~ 0.577.\n                 C is at y = 220 - 173.2 = 46.8.\n            -->\n<line stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"390\" x2=\"90\" y1=\"220\" y2=\"47\"></line>\n<circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"47\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" r=\"4.5\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"75\" y=\"45\">C</text>\n<!-- Angle 30 deg at B -->\n<path d=\"M 330 220 A 60 60 0 0 1 340 191\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"315\" y=\"205\">30°</text>\n<!-- Hanging Weight W: at distance 2/3 L = 200 px from A -> x = 290 -->\n<circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"220\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"290\" x2=\"290\" y1=\"220\" y2=\"280\"></line>\n<rect fill=\"rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.25)\" height=\"35\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#f43f5e\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"40\" x=\"270\" y=\"280\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"290\" y=\"303\">W</text>\n<!-- Distance Dimension (2/3 L) -->\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"90\" x2=\"290\" y1=\"245\" y2=\"245\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"90\" x2=\"90\" y1=\"240\" y2=\"250\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" x1=\"290\" x2=\"290\" y1=\"240\" y2=\"250\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"190\" y=\"260\">2/3 L</text>\n<!-- String Tension Force Vector T at B -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"390\" x2=\"270\" y1=\"220\" y2=\"151\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" x=\"295\" y=\"145\">T = (4/3)W</text>\n<!-- Pivot Force Components at A:\n                 F_x to the right: F_x = 2*sqrt(3)/3 W ~ 1.155 W\n                 F_y upwards: F_y = 1/3 W ~ 0.333 W\n            -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-green)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"90\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"220\" y2=\"220\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"135\" y=\"210\">F_x</text>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-green)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"90\" x2=\"90\" y1=\"220\" y2=\"170\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"98\" y=\"180\">F_y</text>\n<!-- Total Pivot Force F diagonal up-right -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-purple)\" stroke=\"#c084fc\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" x1=\"90\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"220\" y2=\"170\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#c084fc\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" x=\"165\" y=\"165\">F (樞紐合力)</text>\n<!-- Right Box: Free Body Diagram & Calculation -->\n<g transform=\"translate(440, 20)\">\n<rect fill=\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75)\" height=\"325\" rx=\"12\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"300\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"150\" y=\"26\">力矩與力平衡推導</text>\n<!-- Step 1 -->\n<rect fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6)\" height=\"80\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1\" width=\"270\" x=\"15\" y=\"40\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"25\" y=\"60\">1. 以 A 為轉軸列力矩平衡：</text>\n<text fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"35\" y=\"80\">T·sin 30°·L = W·(2/3 L)</text>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"35\" y=\"102\">T·(1/2) = (2/3)W  ⇒  T = (4/3)W</text>\n<!-- Step 2 -->\n<rect fill=\"rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6)\" height=\"85\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"1\" width=\"270\" x=\"15\" y=\"130\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"25\" y=\"150\">2. 正交力平衡求樞紐分力：</text>\n<text fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"35\" y=\"172\">水平：F_x = T·cos 30° = (2√3/3)W</text>\n<text fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"35\" y=\"195\">鉛直：F_y = W - T·sin 30° = (1/3)W</text>\n<!-- Step 3 -->\n<rect fill=\"rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.12)\" height=\"85\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.3)\" stroke-width=\"1\" width=\"270\" x=\"15\" y=\"225\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#c084fc\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" x=\"25\" y=\"245\">3. 合成樞紐總作用力 F：</text>\n<text fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-family=\"'Fira Code', monospace\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"35\" y=\"268\">F = √(F_x² + F_y²)</text>\n<text fill=\"#c084fc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"800\" x=\"35\" y=\"292\">F = √(12/9 + 1/9) W = (√13/3)W</text>\n</g>\n</svg>\n</div>\n<p class=\"question-prompt\">\n          依據力矩與合力平衡推導，牆上樞紐作用於棒之力為多少？\n        </p>\n\n\n</div>",
