    "title": "58. 【平衡 29】緩慢拉起木棒之定性變化",
    "category": "",
    "tags": [
      "講義 靜力學-29"
    ],
    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n          如圖所示，$OP$ 為一均勻木棒，可繞通過 $O$ 點的水平軸自由轉動。若以水平拉力 $\\vec{F}$ 作用於 $P$ 點，將木棒從鉛直下懸的狀態（$\\theta = 0^\\circ$）<strong>緩慢地拉起</strong>，但保持 $\\theta &lt; 90^\\circ$。則在拉起的過程中，水平拉力 $\\vec{F}$ 的<strong>大小</strong>及其相對於轉軸的<strong>力臂</strong>、<strong>力矩</strong>將隨 $\\theta$ 之漸增而作何種變化？\n        </p>\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\n<svg height=\"320\" viewbox=\"0 0 520 320\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow-blue\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-amber\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-emerald\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-rose\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#f43f5e\"></path>\n</marker>\n</defs>\n<!-- Plumb Line from O(220, 50) vertically down -->\n<line stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,4\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" x1=\"220\" x2=\"220\" y1=\"50\" y2=\"290\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#64748b\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"175\" y=\"285\">鉛垂基準線</text>\n<!-- Pivot O -->\n<circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"50\" fill=\"#475569\" r=\"7\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"200\" y=\"45\">O</text>\n<!-- Inclined Rod OP: angle theta ~ 30 deg with vertical -->\n<!-- Length = 220 px -->\n<!-- dx = 220 * sin(30) = 110, dy = 220 * cos(30) = 190.5 -->\n<!-- P = (330, 240.5) -->\n<!-- Midpoint CG = (275, 145.2) -->\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"10\" x1=\"220\" x2=\"330\" y1=\"50\" y2=\"241\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"4\" x1=\"220\" x2=\"330\" y1=\"50\" y2=\"241\"></line>\n<!-- Point P at end -->\n<circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"241\" fill=\"#f43f5e\" r=\"5\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#f43f5e\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"325\" y=\"265\">P</text>\n<!-- Angle theta arc at O -->\n<path d=\"M 220 105 A 55 55 0 0 0 248 98\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"232\" y=\"125\">θ</text>\n<!-- Horizontal Force F at P -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-rose)\" stroke=\"#f43f5e\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"330\" x2=\"440\" y1=\"241\" y2=\"241\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f43f5e\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"400\" y=\"230\">水平拉力 F</text>\n<!-- Midpoint Center of Mass -->\n<circle cx=\"275\" cy=\"145\" fill=\"#10b981\" r=\"5\"></circle>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-emerald)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"275\" x2=\"275\" y1=\"145\" y2=\"225\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"285\" y=\"195\">W</text>\n<text fill=\"#6ee7b7\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"245\" y=\"140\">重心</text>\n<!-- Vertical lever arm for F: l cos theta -->\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\" stroke-width=\"1\" x1=\"220\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"50\" y2=\"50\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\" stroke-width=\"1\" x1=\"330\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"241\" y2=\"241\"></line>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" marker-start=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"170\" x2=\"170\" y1=\"50\" y2=\"241\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" x=\"85\" y=\"150\">力臂 ℓ cosθ</text>\n<!-- Horizontal lever arm for W: (l/2) sin theta -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-emerald)\" marker-start=\"url(#arrow-emerald)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"220\" x2=\"275\" y1=\"260\" y2=\"260\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"220\" y=\"280\">½ ℓ sinθ</text>\n<line opacity=\"0.4\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,2\" stroke-width=\"1\" x1=\"275\" x2=\"275\" y1=\"145\" y2=\"260\"></line>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</div>",
