    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n          一梯子長 $L$ 重量不計，靠在光滑直立牆上。若一人重 $W$ 立於梯的中點，試求<strong>梯子和地面的作用力</strong>為若干？（設梯與鉛直牆面夾角 $\\theta = 30^\\circ$）\n        </p>\n<div class=\"svg-container\">\n<svg height=\"330\" viewbox=\"0 0 520 330\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow-blue\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-amber\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-emerald\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-purple\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#a855f7\"></path>\n</marker>\n<pattern height=\"10\" id=\"hatch-wall\" patterntransform=\"rotate(45 0 0)\" patternunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"10\">\n<line stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"0\" y2=\"10\"></line>\n</pattern>\n</defs>\n<!-- Vertical Smooth Wall on Left -->\n<rect fill=\"url(#hatch-wall)\" height=\"250\" opacity=\"0.3\" width=\"20\" x=\"80\" y=\"30\"></rect>\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"100\" x2=\"100\" y1=\"30\" y2=\"280\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"50\" y=\"20\">光滑鉛直牆</text>\n<!-- Horizontal Ground at Bottom -->\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"80\" x2=\"440\" y1=\"280\" y2=\"280\"></line>\n<rect fill=\"url(#hatch-wall)\" height=\"20\" opacity=\"0.2\" width=\"360\" x=\"80\" y=\"280\"></rect>\n<!-- Ladder: Top at (100, 60), Bottom at (225, 280) -->\n<!-- Height = 220, Width = 125. Angle with vertical = arctan(125/220) ~ 30 deg -->\n<!-- Ladder rails -->\n<line stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"8\" x1=\"100\" x2=\"225\" y1=\"60\" y2=\"280\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" x1=\"100\" x2=\"225\" y1=\"60\" y2=\"280\"></line>\n<!-- Angle theta = 30 deg at top wall -->\n<path d=\"M 100 110 A 50 50 0 0 0 125 103\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n<text fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"110\" y=\"125\">θ = 30°</text>\n<!-- Wall Normal Force N_1 at (100, 60) pointing right -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-purple)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" x1=\"100\" x2=\"175\" y1=\"60\" y2=\"60\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#ec4899\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"182\" y=\"65\">N₁</text>\n<!-- Person standing at midpoint (162.5, 170) -->\n<circle cx=\"162.5\" cy=\"170\" fill=\"#10b981\" r=\"5\"></circle>\n<g transform=\"translate(162.5, 110)\">\n<!-- Small person icon -->\n<circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"15\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" r=\"7\"></circle>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"15\" x2=\"15\" y1=\"22\" y2=\"48\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"15\" x2=\"0\" y1=\"48\" y2=\"60\"></line>\n</g>\n<!-- Weight W at midpoint pointing downward -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-emerald)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" x1=\"162.5\" x2=\"162.5\" y1=\"170\" y2=\"245\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"172\" y=\"235\">W (人重)</text>\n<text fill=\"#6ee7b7\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"110\" y=\"175\">中點 (L/2)</text>\n<!-- Ground Contact Point at (225, 280) -->\n<circle cx=\"225\" cy=\"280\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" r=\"5\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"235\" y=\"295\">地面支點</text>\n<!-- Ground Force Components at (225, 280) -->\n<!-- Friction f pointing left (opposing N1) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"225\" x2=\"155\" y1=\"280\" y2=\"280\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"175\" y=\"272\">f = N₁</text>\n<!-- Normal support N_2 pointing up -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"225\" x2=\"225\" y1=\"280\" y2=\"210\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"232\" y=\"225\">N₂ = W</text>\n<!-- Ground Resultant Force F_地 -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blue)\" stroke=\"#818cf8\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"225\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"280\" y2=\"215\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#a5b4fc\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"115\" y=\"215\">F_地 (作用力)</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</div>",
