    "title": "64. 【平衡 35】輕桿懸掛重物與幾何相似力三角形",
    "category": "",
    "tags": [
      "講義 靜力學-30"
    ],
    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n            如圖所示，桿重不計，設鉛直牆上 $AC$ 距離固定 $\\overline{AC}=a$，桿長 $\\overline{AB}=\\ell$。端點 $B$ 掛一重物 $W$。若將 $BC$ 繩縮短則 $AB$ 桿抬高（仰角 $\\theta$ 增大），反之若將繩放長則 $AB$ 桿降低。\n          </p>\n<p>\n            關於桿所受樞紐 $A$ 之力與細繩張力之變化，下列敘述哪些正確？<strong>（多選）</strong>\n</p>\n\n</div>",
    "options": [],
    "svg": "<svg class=\"exam-diagram-svg\" style=\" border-radius: 8px;\" viewbox=\"0 0 540 370\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arr-c\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arr-g\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arr-r\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arr-y\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n</defs>\n<!-- Wall AC -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"5\" x1=\"120\" x2=\"120\" y1=\"40\" y2=\"330\"></line>\n<!-- Wall hatchings -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"100\" x2=\"120\" y1=\"60\" y2=\"80\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"100\" x2=\"120\" y1=\"120\" y2=\"140\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"100\" x2=\"120\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"200\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"100\" x2=\"120\" y1=\"240\" y2=\"260\"></line>\n<!-- Points: A=(120, 260), C=(120, 80) => AC = a -->\n<!-- B=(360, 180) => rod AB length ell -->\n<!-- Distance AC label -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"85\" x2=\"85\" y1=\"80\" y2=\"260\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"60\" y=\"175\">a (固定)</text>\n<!-- String BC -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 3\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"120\" x2=\"360\" y1=\"80\" y2=\"180\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" x=\"235\" y=\"115\">繩長 BC (張力 T)</text>\n<!-- Rod AB -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"7\" x1=\"120\" x2=\"360\" y1=\"260\" y2=\"180\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"120\" x2=\"360\" y1=\"260\" y2=\"180\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"210\" y=\"240\">桿長 ℓ</text>\n<!-- Angle theta at A -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"120\" x2=\"220\" y1=\"260\" y2=\"260\"></line>\n<path d=\"M 160 260 A 40 40 0 0 0 157 248\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" x=\"170\" y=\"255\">θ</text>\n<!-- Weight hanging from B -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arr-y)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"360\" x2=\"360\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"270\"></line>\n<!-- Hinge Force N at B along AB pointing outward -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arr-g)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"360\" x2=\"430\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"157\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"435\" y=\"155\">N (桿支撐力)</text>\n<!-- Vector triangle inset on right side -->\n<g transform=\"translate(100, 0)\">\n<rect fill=\"none\" height=\"135\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" width=\"100\" x=\"330\" y=\"30\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"340\" y=\"48\">封閉力向量</text>\n<!-- Vector W down -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arr-y)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"410\" x2=\"410\" y1=\"60\" y2=\"140\"></line>\n<!-- Vector N up-right -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"350\" x2=\"410\" y1=\"140\" y2=\"140\"></line>\n<!-- Vector T up-left -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"410\" x2=\"350\" y1=\"60\" y2=\"140\"></line>\n</g>\n<!-- Point Labels -->\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"100\" y=\"268\">A</text>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"100\" y=\"85\">C</text>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"370\" y=\"180\">B</text>\n</svg>",
    "diagrams": [],
    "related": [],
    "answer": "(A)",
    "solutions": []
