    "title": "72. 【平衡 43】小童沿木板等速下滑之牆面與地面力變化",
    "category": "",
    "tags": [
      "講義 靜力學-31"
    ],
    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n            如圖所示，取一均質木板一端靠於鉛直光滑牆面，另一端以樞紐固定於水平地面。\n          </p>\n<p>\n            今若一小童自此木板高處<strong>等速滑下</strong>，下滑過程中木板保持固定且不變形。若此期間光滑牆對木板之作用力為 $X$，地面對木板之作用力為 $Y$。\n          </p>\n<p>\n            則此兩力在小童之下滑過程中，如何變化？\n          </p>\n\n</div>",
    "options": [],
    "svg": "<svg class=\"exam-diagram-svg\" style=\" border-radius: 8px;\" viewbox=\"0 0 540 370\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arr-c\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arr-g\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arr-r\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arr-y\" markerheight=\"6\" markerwidth=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"5\" viewbox=\"0 0 10 10\">\n<path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n</defs>\n<!-- Wall and Ground -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"4\" x1=\"120\" x2=\"120\" y1=\"50\" y2=\"300\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"4\" x1=\"80\" x2=\"480\" y1=\"300\" y2=\"300\"></line>\n<!-- Wall hatchings -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"105\" x2=\"120\" y1=\"70\" y2=\"85\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"105\" x2=\"120\" y1=\"120\" y2=\"135\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"105\" x2=\"120\" y1=\"170\" y2=\"185\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"105\" x2=\"120\" y1=\"220\" y2=\"235\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"105\" x2=\"120\" y1=\"270\" y2=\"285\"></line>\n<!-- Wooden Board: from top B=(120, 100) to ground hinge A=(380, 300) -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"8\" x1=\"120\" x2=\"380\" y1=\"100\" y2=\"300\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"4\" x1=\"120\" x2=\"380\" y1=\"100\" y2=\"300\"></line>\n<!-- Smooth wall force X at B=(120, 100) pointing RIGHT -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arr-g)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" x1=\"120\" x2=\"190\" y1=\"100\" y2=\"100\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"195\" y=\"95\">X (牆面力，水平向右)</text>\n<!-- Ground Hinge A at (380, 300) -->\n<circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"300\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" r=\"6\"></circle>\n<!-- Ground force Y from A pointing up-left -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arr-c)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" x1=\"380\" x2=\"310\" y1=\"300\" y2=\"190\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"315\" y=\"180\">Y (地面力)</text>\n<!-- Sliding Child: sliding down along board -->\n<circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"169\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" r=\"9\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"225\" y=\"160\">👦 小童等速下滑 (v = 常數)</text>\n<!-- Velocity arrow along board -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arr-y)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"220\" x2=\"250\" y1=\"177\" y2=\"200\"></line>\n<!-- Total gravity W (Board + Child) pointing DOWN -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arr-y)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"250\" x2=\"250\" y1=\"200\" y2=\"290\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"258\" y=\"275\">W_總 (定值)</text>\n<!-- Vector triangle inset on top-right -->\n<g transform=\"translate(350, 40)\">\n<rect fill=\"none\" height=\"110\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" width=\"160\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></rect>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arr-g)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"30\" x2=\"80\" y1=\"40\" y2=\"40\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"11\" x=\"50\" y=\"35\">X</text>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arr-c)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"80\" x2=\"30\" y1=\"40\" y2=\"95\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"11\" x=\"65\" y=\"75\">Y</text>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arr-y)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"30\" x2=\"30\" y1=\"95\" y2=\"40\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"12\" y=\"105\">X + Y = -W (定向量)</text>\n</g>\n</svg>",
    "diagrams": [],
    "related": [],
    "answer": "(E)",
    "solutions": []
