    "title": "81. 【摩擦 1】筷子夾滷蛋平衡之受力分析",
    "category": "",
    "tags": [
      "講義 靜力學-34"
    ],
    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n            某生用一雙筷子夾一個滷蛋，靜止於空中，滷蛋不會掉下之原因為下列何者？\n          </p>\n\n</div>",
    "options": [],
    "svg": "<svg class=\"exam-diagram-svg\" style=\"max-width: 580px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" viewbox=\"0 0 540 360\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrowRed\" markerheight=\"10\" markerwidth=\"10\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"3\">\n<path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrowGreen\" markerheight=\"10\" markerwidth=\"10\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"3\">\n<path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrowCyan\" markerheight=\"10\" markerwidth=\"10\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"3\">\n<path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<radialgradient cx=\"45%\" cy=\"40%\" id=\"eggGrad\" r=\"55%\">\n<stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#d97706\"></stop>\n<stop offset=\"70%\" stop-color=\"#92400e\"></stop>\n<stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#451a03\"></stop>\n</radialgradient>\n</defs>\n<!-- Chopsticks (left and right) -->\n<!-- Left chopstick -->\n<rect fill=\"#78350f\" height=\"240\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"16\" x=\"175\" y=\"60\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"183\" y=\"50\">左筷</text>\n<!-- Right chopstick -->\n<rect fill=\"#78350f\" height=\"240\" rx=\"6\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"16\" x=\"349\" y=\"60\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"357\" y=\"50\">右筷</text>\n<!-- Braised Egg in between -->\n<ellipse cx=\"270\" cy=\"180\" fill=\"url(#eggGrad)\" rx=\"80\" ry=\"60\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></ellipse>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"270\" y=\"185\">滷蛋 (靜止)</text>\n<!-- Normal force from chopsticks pressing inward -->\n<!-- Left normal force N1 on egg (pointing right) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowCyan)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"191\" x2=\"235\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"180\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"210\" y=\"170\">N₁</text>\n<!-- Right normal force N2 on egg (pointing left) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowCyan)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"349\" x2=\"305\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"180\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"315\" y=\"170\">N₂</text>\n<!-- Friction forces pointing UPWARDS at contact surfaces -->\n<!-- Left contact friction f1 -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowGreen)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" x1=\"193\" x2=\"193\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"115\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"140\" y=\"130\">f₁ (靜摩擦)</text>\n<!-- Right contact friction f2 -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowGreen)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" x1=\"347\" x2=\"347\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"115\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"365\" y=\"130\">f₂ (靜摩擦)</text>\n<!-- Gravity W pointing DOWNWARDS from center of egg -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowRed)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" x1=\"270\" x2=\"270\" y1=\"190\" y2=\"280\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"280\" y=\"270\">W (蛋重)</text>\n<!-- Summary formula banner inside SVG -->\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"270\" y=\"336\">靜力平衡：f₁ + f₂ = W</text>\n</svg>",
    "diagrams": [],
    "related": [],
    "answer": "(D)",
    "solutions": []
