    "title": "86. 【摩擦 6】小蟲爬半球碗壁之最大鉛直高度",
    "category": "",
    "tags": [
      "講義 靜力學-35"
    ],
    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n            一小蟲在半徑為 $R$ 之半球面碗壁沿壁上爬，若蟲與碗壁間的靜摩擦係數為 $\\mu_s = \\sqrt{3}$，則此小蟲可爬昇距碗底之最大鉛直高度為若干？\n          </p>\n\n</div>",
    "options": [],
    "svg": "<svg class=\"exam-diagram-svg\" style=\"max-width: 580px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" viewbox=\"0 0 540 360\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrowRed\" markerheight=\"10\" markerwidth=\"10\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"3\">\n<path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrowGreen\" markerheight=\"10\" markerwidth=\"10\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"3\">\n<path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrowCyan\" markerheight=\"10\" markerwidth=\"10\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"3\">\n<path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<lineargradient id=\"bowlGrad\" x1=\"0%\" x2=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" y2=\"100%\">\n<stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#3b82f6\" stop-opacity=\"0.15\"></stop>\n<stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#1e3a8a\" stop-opacity=\"0.3\"></stop>\n</lineargradient>\n</defs>\n<!-- Hemispherical Bowl: Center at (270, 90), Radius R = 180 -->\n<!-- Bowl bottom at y = 90 + 180 = 270. Left rim (90, 90), Right rim (450, 90) -->\n<path d=\"M90,90 A180,180 0 0,0 450,90 Z\" fill=\"url(#bowlGrad)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\"></path>\n<!-- Outer stand / rim -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"4\" x1=\"70\" x2=\"470\" y1=\"90\" y2=\"90\"></line>\n<!-- Center O of bowl -->\n<circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"90\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"270\" y=\"75\">球心 O</text>\n<!-- Vertical center dashed line (radius) -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,4\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"270\" x2=\"270\" y1=\"90\" y2=\"270\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"280\" y=\"260\">碗底</text>\n<!-- Position of bug at critical angle θ = 60° from vertical -->\n<!-- Center at (270, 90). Angle from downward vertical: 60° to left -->\n<!-- x = 270 - 180 * sin(60°) = 270 - 155.88 = 114.1 -->\n<!-- y = 90 + 180 * cos(60°) = 90 + 90 = 180 -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"270\" x2=\"114\" y1=\"90\" y2=\"180\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"200\" y=\"125\">R</text>\n<!-- Angle θ arc at O -->\n<path d=\"M270,140 A50,50 0 0,1 227,115\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"240\" y=\"150\">θ=60°</text>\n<!-- Bug at (114, 180) -->\n<circle cx=\"114\" cy=\"180\" fill=\"#ef4444\" r=\"8\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"75\" y=\"175\">小蟲</text>\n<!-- Forces on bug at (114, 180) -->\n<!-- 1. Normal N pointing to center (up-right along radius) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowCyan)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"114\" x2=\"192\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"135\"></line>\n<!-- 2. Friction fs pointing along tangent (up-left, perpendicular to radius) -->\n<!-- Radius vector: dx = -156, dy = 90. Tangent (up-left): dx = -90, dy = -156 -->\n<!-- Unit tangent: (-0.5, -0.866). Length 60: dx = -30, dy = -52 => (84, 128) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowGreen)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"114\" x2=\"84\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"128\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"50\" y=\"125\">fs (靜摩擦)</text>\n<!-- 3. Gravity mg pointing DOWN -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowRed)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"114\" x2=\"114\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"255\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"122\" y=\"245\">mg</text>\n<!-- Height dimensions on right -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"390\" x2=\"480\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"180\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,3\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" x1=\"270\" x2=\"480\" y1=\"270\" y2=\"270\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"470\" x2=\"470\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"270\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"465\" x2=\"475\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"180\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"465\" x2=\"475\" y1=\"270\" y2=\"270\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"495\" y=\"230\">h = R/2</text>\n</svg>",
