    "title": "87. 【摩擦 7】雙層木塊滑輪連接體拉動臨界分析",
    "category": "",
    "tags": [
      "講義 靜力學-35"
    ],
    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n            附圖所示之連接體中，設 $A$ 與 $B$ 間之靜摩擦係數為 $0.2$，$B$ 與水平桌面間之靜摩擦係數為 $0.4$。已知 $A$ 的質量為 $2\\text{ kg}$，$B$ 為 $10\\text{ kg}$。設滑輪與繩的質量及摩擦皆不計，則懸掛物 $C$ 至少要多少公斤重（$\\text{kgw}$）才能拉動此連接體？\n          </p>\n\n</div>",
    "options": [],
    "svg": "<svg class=\"exam-diagram-svg\" style=\"max-width: 580px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" viewbox=\"0 0 540 360\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrowRed\" markerheight=\"10\" markerwidth=\"10\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"3\">\n<path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrowCyan\" markerheight=\"10\" markerwidth=\"10\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"3\">\n<path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrowGreen\" markerheight=\"10\" markerwidth=\"10\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"3\">\n<path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n</defs>\n<!-- Table ground -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"80\" x2=\"480\" y1=\"230\" y2=\"230\"></line>\n<path d=\"M90,230 l-10,12 M120,230 l-10,12 M150,230 l-10,12 M180,230 l-10,12 M210,230 l-10,12 M240,230 l-10,12 M270,230 l-10,12 M300,230 l-10,12 M330,230 l-10,12 M360,230 l-10,12 M390,230 l-10,12 M420,230 l-10,12 M450,230 l-10,12\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n<!-- Left table edge and pulley at left -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"80\" x2=\"80\" y1=\"230\" y2=\"330\"></line>\n<!-- Left pulley at (80, 200) -->\n<circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"195\" fill=\"#475569\" r=\"14\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"195\" fill=\"#0f172a\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n<!-- Block B: width 150, height 40. From x=220 to 370, y=190 to 230 -->\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"295\" y=\"215\">B (10 kg)</text>\n<!-- Block A: width 90, height 35. From x=240 to 330, y=155 to 190 -->\n<rect fill=\"#e2e8f0\" height=\"35\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"90\" x=\"240\" y=\"155\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"285\" y=\"178\">A (2 kg)</text>\n<!-- Pulley on the right of B: attached to B or wall? Attached to B right extension or wall at x=440 -->\n<!-- In handout diagram, a bracket extends from the right wall, holding a pulley at x=430 -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"4\" x1=\"480\" x2=\"480\" y1=\"120\" y2=\"230\"></line>\n<!-- Right pulley bracket from wall -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"480\" x2=\"445\" y1=\"172\" y2=\"172\"></line>\n<circle cx=\"445\" cy=\"172\" fill=\"#475569\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"445\" cy=\"172\" fill=\"#0f172a\" r=\"3\"></circle>\n<!-- String 1 (connecting A to B via right pulley): -->\n<!-- From A right side (330, 165) to top of pulley (445, 160) -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"330\" x2=\"445\" y1=\"165\" y2=\"160\"></line>\n<!-- Around pulley to bottom tangent (445, 184) and connecting to B right side (370, 205) -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"445\" x2=\"370\" y1=\"184\" y2=\"205\"></line>\n<!-- String 2 (from B left side to left pulley and hanging C): -->\n<!-- From B left side (220, 205) to top of left pulley (80, 181) -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"220\" x2=\"80\" y1=\"205\" y2=\"181\"></line>\n<!-- Hanging down to C -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"66\" x2=\"66\" y1=\"195\" y2=\"270\"></line>\n<!-- Block C -->\n<rect fill=\"#f59e0b\" height=\"42\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"36\" x=\"48\" y=\"270\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" x=\"66\" y=\"296\">C</text>\n<!-- Force labels -->\n<!-- Tension Tc pulling C -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowRed)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"66\" x2=\"66\" y1=\"312\" y2=\"350\"></line>\n<!-- Tension on B pulling left -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowCyan)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"220\" x2=\"140\" y1=\"205\" y2=\"205\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"175\" y=\"195\">T_C</text>\n<!-- Forces resisting B on the right: -->\n<!-- 1. Layer friction f_AB to right on B: 0.4 kgw -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowGreen)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"310\" x2=\"360\" y1=\"190\" y2=\"190\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"320\" y=\"180\">f_AB = 0.4</text>\n<!-- 2. String tension T_A to right on B: 0.4 kgw -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowCyan)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"370\" x2=\"420\" y1=\"205\" y2=\"205\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"380\" y=\"222\">T_A = 0.4</text>\n<!-- 3. Ground friction f_地 to right on B: 4.8 kgw -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowGreen)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"270\" x2=\"340\" y1=\"230\" y2=\"230\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"290\" y=\"250\">f_地 = 4.8</text>\n<!-- Summary callout -->\n</svg>",
