    "title": "88. 【摩擦 8】繩結共點力傳遞與實際靜摩擦力判斷",
    "category": "",
    "tags": [
      "講義 靜力學-35"
    ],
    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n            重量 $10\\text{ kgw}$ 的木塊 $A$ 置於水平桌面，接觸面的最大靜摩擦係數為 $0.40$。當懸掛重物 $W$ 為 $3\\text{ kgw}$ 時，作用於木塊 $A$ 的摩擦力為多少 $\\text{kgw}$？\n          </p>\n\n</div>",
    "options": [],
    "svg": "<svg class=\"exam-diagram-svg\" style=\"max-width: 580px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" viewbox=\"0 0 540 360\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrowRed\" markerheight=\"10\" markerwidth=\"10\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"3\">\n<path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrowCyan\" markerheight=\"10\" markerwidth=\"10\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"3\">\n<path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrowGreen\" markerheight=\"10\" markerwidth=\"10\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"8\" refy=\"3\">\n<path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L9,3 z\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\"></path>\n</marker>\n</defs>\n<!-- Table on left -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"40\" x2=\"280\" y1=\"210\" y2=\"210\"></line>\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"280\" x2=\"280\" y1=\"210\" y2=\"330\"></line>\n<path d=\"M50,210 l-10,12 M80,210 l-10,12 M110,210 l-10,12 M140,210 l-10,12 M170,210 l-10,12 M200,210 l-10,12 M230,210 l-10,12 M260,210 l-10,12\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n<!-- Wall on right -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"460\" x2=\"460\" y1=\"70\" y2=\"250\"></line>\n<path d=\"M460,80 l12,-8 M460,110 l12,-8 M460,140 l12,-8 M460,170 l12,-8 M460,200 l12,-8 M460,230 l12,-8\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n<!-- Block A on table (width 80, height 45): x=150 to 230, y=165 to 210 -->\n<rect fill=\"#e2e8f0\" height=\"45\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"80\" x=\"150\" y=\"165\"></rect>\n<!-- Node O at (360, 187) -->\n<!-- String 1: Horizontal from block A right side (230, 187) to Node O (360, 187) -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"230\" x2=\"360\" y1=\"187\" y2=\"187\"></line>\n<!-- String 2: 45° line from Node O (360, 187) to Wall at (460, 87) -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"360\" x2=\"460\" y1=\"187\" y2=\"87\"></line>\n<!-- String 3: Vertical from Node O (360, 187) to hanging weight W (360, 260) -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"360\" x2=\"360\" y1=\"187\" y2=\"260\"></line>\n<!-- Node O dot -->\n<circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"187\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" r=\"5\"></circle>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"345\" y=\"175\">O</text>\n<!-- Angle 45° at wall / string -->\n<path d=\"M460,120 A33,33 0 0,1 437,110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"425\" y=\"135\">45°</text>\n<!-- Weight W (3 kgw) -->\n<rect fill=\"#f59e0b\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"40\" x=\"340\" y=\"260\"></rect>\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowRed)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"360\" x2=\"360\" y1=\"300\" y2=\"345\"></line>\n<!-- Forces on block A -->\n<!-- Tension T_A pulling RIGHT: 3 kgw -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowCyan)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"230\" x2=\"280\" y1=\"187\" y2=\"187\"></line>\n<!-- Static friction fs pointing LEFT: 3 kgw -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrowGreen)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"150\" x2=\"95\" y1=\"210\" y2=\"210\"></line>\n<!-- Max static friction callout banner -->\n</svg>",
