    "title": "93. 【摩擦 13】斜面上兩方塊水平推力分析",
    "category": "",
    "tags": [
      "講義 靜力學-36"
    ],
    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n            如圖所示，一固定斜面上有 $a$、$b$ 兩個正方形物體，它們的質量相等。$F$ 是沿水平方向作用於 $a$ 的外力。已知 $a$、$b$ 的接觸面及 $a$、$b$ 與斜面的接觸面都是光滑的，則下列敘述何者正確？\n          </p>\n\n</div>",
    "options": [],
    "svg": "<svg class=\"exam-diagram-svg\" style=\"max-width: 580px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" viewbox=\"0 0 540 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<!-- Ground -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"50\" x2=\"490\" y1=\"240\" y2=\"240\"></line>\n<path d=\"M60 240 l-10 12 M90 240 l-10 12 M120 240 l-10 12 M150 240 l-10 12 M180 240 l-10 12 M210 240 l-10 12 M240 240 l-10 12 M270 240 l-10 12 M300 240 l-10 12 M330 240 l-10 12 M360 240 l-10 12 M390 240 l-10 12 M420 240 l-10 12 M450 240 l-10 12\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n<!-- Incline: Base from (130,240) to (370,240), height at (370,100), slope ~ 30 deg -->\n<polygon fill=\"none\" points=\"130,240 370,240 370,100\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></polygon>\n<path d=\"M 180 240 A 50 50 0 0 0 173 215\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"190\" y=\"232\">θ</text>\n<!-- Slope incline angle: ~ 30.25 deg -->\n<!-- Block a and Block b aligned along incline -->\n<!-- Let's put a group rotated by -30.25 deg at (130, 240) -->\n<g transform=\"translate(130, 240) rotate(-30.25)\">\n<!-- Distance along incline: block a from 40 to 90, block b from 90 to 140 -->\n<!-- Block a -->\n<rect fill=\"none\" height=\"45\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"50\" x=\"40\" y=\"-45\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"60\" y=\"-18\">a</text>\n<!-- Block b -->\n<rect fill=\"none\" height=\"45\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"50\" x=\"90\" y=\"-45\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"110\" y=\"-18\">b</text>\n<!-- Normal force on b from incline -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-purple-13)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"115\" x2=\"115\" y1=\"-22\" y2=\"-65\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"120\" y=\"-60\">Nb</text>\n<!-- Normal force on a from incline -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-cyan-13)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"65\" x2=\"65\" y1=\"-22\" y2=\"-75\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"70\" y=\"-70\">Na</text>\n</g>\n<!-- Force F pushing horizontally on a -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red-13)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"80\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"200\" y2=\"200\"></line>\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow-red-13\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#cbd5e1\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-purple-13\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#cbd5e1\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-cyan-13\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#cbd5e1\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n</defs>\n</svg>",
    "diagrams": [],
