    "title": "95. 【摩擦 15】堆疊楔形木塊砝碼滑動判斷",
    "category": "",
    "tags": [
      "講義 靜力學-37"
    ],
    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n            水平桌面上置有 A、B 兩塊楔形木塊，呈靜止狀態，如圖所示。A、B 木塊的重量分別為 $2\\text{ kgw}$ 與 $4\\text{ kgw}$，A 與 B 接觸面的靜摩擦係數為 $\\mu_s = 0.8$。\n          </p>\n<p>\n            今將每一個均為 $1\\text{ kgw}$ 的砝碼置於 A 上，則當放置幾個砝碼時將會使 A 下滑？\n          </p>\n\n</div>",
    "options": [],
    "svg": "<svg class=\"exam-diagram-svg\" style=\"max-width: 580px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" viewbox=\"0 0 540 320\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<!-- Ground -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"50\" x2=\"490\" y1=\"260\" y2=\"260\"></line>\n<path d=\"M60 260 l-10 12 M90 260 l-10 12 M120 260 l-10 12 M150 260 l-10 12 M180 260 l-10 12 M210 260 l-10 12 M240 260 l-10 12 M270 260 l-10 12 M300 260 l-10 12 M330 260 l-10 12 M360 260 l-10 12 M390 260 l-10 12 M420 260 l-10 12 M450 260 l-10 12\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n<!-- Combined Rectangular Block divided diagonally: Left x=160, right x=380. Top y=80, bottom y=260 -->\n<!-- Wedge B (bottom-left triangle): (160,80) to (160,260) to (380,260) -->\n<polygon fill=\"none\" points=\"160,80 160,260 380,260\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></polygon>\n<!-- Wedge A (top-right triangle): (160,80) to (380,80) to (380,260) -->\n<polygon fill=\"none\" points=\"160,80 380,80 380,260\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></polygon>\n<!-- Angle 37 deg at (380, 260) -->\n<path d=\"M 330 260 A 50 50 0 0 1 340 228\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"310\" y=\"245\">37°</text>\n<!-- Weights added on top of A -->\n<rect fill=\"none\" height=\"35\" rx=\"3\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"80\" x=\"250\" y=\"45\"></rect>\n<!-- Friction comparison banner -->\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"58\" y=\"132\">下滑分力：</text>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"58\" y=\"150\">0.60 Mg</text>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"58\" y=\"168\">fs,max=0.64Mg</text>\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow-yellow-15\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#cbd5e1\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n</defs>\n</svg>",
    "diagrams": [],
    "related": [],
    "answer": "(E)",
    "solutions": []
