    "title": "103. 【摩擦 23】雙箱滑輪連接等速移動分析",
    "category": "",
    "tags": [
      "111 分科測驗名題",
      "講義 靜力學-39 (完結篇)"
    ],
    "content": "<div class=\"item-text\">\n<p>\n            在水平地面上，以不可伸長的細繩繞過定滑輪，將質量分別為 $m_1$、$m_2$ 的上、下兩個均質箱子連接如圖。已知重力加速度為 $g$，細繩與滑輪之間無摩擦力，且其質量均可忽略，下箱之上、下表面的動摩擦係數皆為 $\\mu$。\n          </p>\n<p>\n            若下箱受到水平拉力 $F$ 時，兩箱不轉動，均以等速度水平移動，則下列敘述哪些正確？<strong>（多選）</strong>\n</p>\n\n</div>",
    "options": [],
    "svg": "<svg class=\"exam-diagram-svg\" style=\"max-width: 580px; width: 100%; height: auto;\" viewbox=\"0 0 540 320\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<!-- Ground -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"30\" x2=\"480\" y1=\"240\" y2=\"240\"></line>\n<path d=\"M40 240 l-10 12 M70 240 l-10 12 M100 240 l-10 12 M130 240 l-10 12 M160 240 l-10 12 M190 240 l-10 12 M220 240 l-10 12 M250 240 l-10 12 M280 240 l-10 12 M310 240 l-10 12 M340 240 l-10 12 M370 240 l-10 12 M400 240 l-10 12 M430 240 l-10 12 M460 240 l-10 12\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n<!-- Right Wall for Pulley mount: at x=440 from y=80 to 240 -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3\" x1=\"440\" x2=\"440\" y1=\"80\" y2=\"240\"></line>\n<path d=\"M440 90 l12 -10 M440 120 l12 -10 M440 150 l12 -10 M440 180 l12 -10 M440 210 l12 -10\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n<!-- Lower Box m2: from x=160 to x=340, y=180 to 240 (width 180, height 60) -->\n<rect fill=\"none\" height=\"60\" rx=\"3\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" width=\"180\" x=\"160\" y=\"180\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"235\" y=\"215\">m₂</text>\n<!-- Upper Box m1: from x=180 to x=270, y=130 to 180 (width 90, height 50) -->\n<rect fill=\"none\" height=\"50\" rx=\"3\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" width=\"90\" x=\"180\" y=\"130\"></rect>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"215\" y=\"162\">m₁</text>\n<!-- Pulley at right: center (380, 180), radius 22 -->\n<circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"180\" fill=\"#1e293b\" r=\"22\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n<circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"180\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n<!-- Pulley bracket to wall -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"380\" x2=\"440\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"180\"></line>\n<!-- Force F' from wall/bracket -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-cyan-23)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" x1=\"440\" x2=\"410\" y1=\"180\" y2=\"180\"></line>\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" x=\"405\" y=\"170\">F'</text>\n<!-- String top: from m1 right side (270, 158) to pulley top (380, 158) -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"270\" x2=\"380\" y1=\"158\" y2=\"158\"></line>\n<!-- String bottom: from pulley bottom (380, 202) to m2 right side (340, 202) -->\n<line stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"2\" x1=\"380\" x2=\"340\" y1=\"202\" y2=\"202\"></line>\n<!-- Pulling Force F on m2 (to the left): at (160, 210) -->\n<line marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red-23)\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" x1=\"160\" x2=\"80\" y1=\"210\" y2=\"210\"></line>\n<!-- Friction forces indicators -->\n<!-- Between m1 and m2 -->\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"180\" y=\"195\">動摩擦 μ</text>\n<!-- Between m2 and floor -->\n<text fill=\"#f1f5f9\" font-family=\"inherit\" font-size=\"12\" x=\"210\" y=\"255\">動摩擦 μ</text>\n<defs>\n<marker id=\"arrow-red-23\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#cbd5e1\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n<marker id=\"arrow-cyan-23\" markerheight=\"8\" markerwidth=\"8\" orient=\"auto\" refx=\"7\" refy=\"4\">\n<polygon fill=\"#cbd5e1\" points=\"0 0, 8 4, 0 8\"></polygon>\n</marker>\n</defs>\n</svg>",
